{
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_446_thiefs_escape.txt/0": "<PLAYER>使用了盗贼步法！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_446_thiefs_escape.txt/1": "但移动目标处被挡住了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_459_lv1_down_weapon.txt/0": "武器耐久度下降了10！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_45_summon.txt/0": "<PLAYER>使用了\r\n召唤魔法！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_45_summon.txt/1": "但是同伴数量\r\n已经达到上限！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_45_summon.txt/2": "召唤兽成为了\r\n你的同伴！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_45_summon.txt/3": "但你已经带着\r\n一只召唤兽了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_460_lv1_down_armor.txt/0": "护甲耐久度下降了10！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_461_lv1_down_equip.txt/0": "武器和护甲\r\n耐久度下降了10！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_462_lv2_down_weapon.txt/0": "武器耐久度下降了20！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_463_lv2_down_armor.txt/0": "护甲耐久度下降了20！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_464_lv2_down_equip.txt/0": "武器和护甲\r\n耐久度下降了20！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_465_lv3_down_weapon.txt/0": "武器耐久度下降了30！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_466_lv3_down_armor.txt/0": "护甲耐久度下降了30！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_467_lv3_down_equip.txt/0": "武器和护甲耐久度\r\n下降了30！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_480_skeltongunner_chainattack.txt/0": "连击！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_480_skeltongunner_chainattack.txt/1": "连击！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_481_selectaction.txt/0": "舍身攻击！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_498_hit_melt.txt/0": "帝王虫喷出了溶解液！\r\n武器耐久度下降了10！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_533_ashura.txt/0": "阿修罗推掌！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_533_ashura.txt/1": "“金刚”阿修罗推掌·地！！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_533_ashura.txt/2": "“金刚”阿修罗推掌·天！！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_75_friendly.txt/0": "<TARGET>变得友好了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_75_friendly.txt/1": "你真以为这种东西\r\n对冥王会有用吗！！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_75_friendly.txt/2": "对<TARGET>没有效果……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_78_jump.txt/0": "传送药水\r\n对<TARGET>生效了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_97_nemuri_heal.txt/0": "治疗就交给我吧！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_97_nemuri_heal.txt/1": "<PLAYER>！你没事吧？！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_97_nemuri_heal.txt/2": "这是……最后的治疗！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_97_nemuri_heal.txt/3": "最后的治疗！是特别制作的！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_97_nemuri_heal.txt/4": "对不起。\r\n药草已经……。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/877": "\\c[3]怎样才能打倒Zeukrees？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/968": "\\c[3]关于神圣武具。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/1076": "想了解冒险的诀窍！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/1156": "告诉我现在的同伴情况！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/1216": "想听你讲讲地形！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/1359": "想闲聊！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/1412": "还是算了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/0": "所以呢？有什么想问的吗？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/1": "那么，是什么？想问我什么？\r\n我什么都会告诉你哦～。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2": "那么，有什么问题要问\r\n这位可爱又优秀的妖精梅莫莉娅？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2070": "走进光里会发生什么？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2122": "如果被墙挡住了怎么办？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2169": "EN快耗尽时该怎么办？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2218": "给我讲讲装备吧。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2260": "回过神来发现被敌人包围了……",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2304": "陷阱好可怕！该怎么办？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2354": "我不知道城镇在哪里。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2404": "该怎样为逼近的决战做准备？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2453": "还是算了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3": "嗯，你想知道什么？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2786": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“草原”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2861": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“荒野”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/2935": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“遗迹群”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3009": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“雪原”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3087": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“山岳地带”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3165": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“火山”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3240": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“沙漠”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3314": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“侵蚀地带”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3392": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这座“要塞”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3468": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“海岸”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3542": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这座“大洞窟”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3621": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“天空”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3693": "\\c[1]告诉我现在这片“大森林”的特点！！\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3805": "\\c[1]梦幻回廊是什么样的地方？\\c[0]",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3896": "告诉我“草原”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/3968": "告诉我“荒野”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4038": "告诉我“遗迹群”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4108": "告诉我“雪原”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4183": "告诉我“山岳地带”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4257": "告诉我“火山”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4329": "告诉我“沙漠”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4400": "告诉我“海岸”的特点！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4516": "还是算了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/4": "嗯，你想了解哪个地区？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk.txt/5": "明白了。\r\n想知道什么就随时问我。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/0": "“\\c[52]草原\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n嗯——算是比较安全的地区吧。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/1": "危险地形不多，\r\n城镇容易出现，还能获得许多\r\n可以恢复EN的食物！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/2": "能补给道具时就该及时补给，\r\n可不能放松警惕哦！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/3": "“\\c[52]荒野\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n不算很危险……但药草几乎都枯了，\r\n城镇也不多。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/4": "危险地形似乎不多。\r\n但要注意EN耗尽。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/5": "有时会出现动物、亚人或盗贼类\r\n魔物。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/6": "“\\c[52]遗迹群\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n地下城很多呢。\r\n喜欢冒险的人一定会爱上这里。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/7": "此外，药水、武器、护甲和卷轴\r\n也经常掉落在这一带。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/8": "我觉得这里非常适合强化战力。\r\n不过要注意\r\n携带食物的数量。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/9": "魔物以亚人和亡灵居多。\r\n要小心会用远程攻击的敌人。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/10": "“\\c[52]雪原\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n最大的特点就是……冷！！！\r\nEN会飞速减少……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/11": "进入雪原后，如果需要，\r\n我会躲进\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的背包里，请多关照。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/12": "就算恢复EN，也会马上减少，\r\n所以不恢复EN，一口气冲到暖和的地方，\r\n也许反而更好。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/13": "这里几乎没有能填饱肚子的食物，\r\n但强敌很多，难免要战斗，\r\nEN为零时作战会非常艰难。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/14": "必须和强敌战斗时，\r\n先吃点药草恢复少量EN，\r\n然后再战斗会比较好。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/15": "“\\c[52]山岳地带\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n这里是很容易获得\r\n恢复EN道具的地方。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/16": "食物最好在这里补充。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/17": "魔物似乎以鸟类和动物类居多。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/18": "“\\c[52]火山\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n这里几乎没有城镇。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/19": "当然啦，那里热得根本\r\n没法住人。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/20": "到处都有熔岩，要小心！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/21": "掉进熔岩基本就是游戏结束！\r\n会死的。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/22": "当然，能找到的药草也几乎都被烤焦了。\r\n宝石倒是有些掉落，\r\n能拿去当旅费就好了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/23": "“\\c[52]沙漠\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n这里整片都被沙子覆盖。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/24": "沙地会让移动变慢。\r\nST会自行减少，\r\nEN不足时似乎就无法恢复。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/25": "和会飞的魔物战斗时要小心。\r\n它们飞行时不受地形影响，\r\n可能会一拥而上围攻你。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/26": "而且一旦被发现，它们速度更快，\r\n很容易就追上来。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/27": "堕天使当然也会飞，\r\n所以在沙漠里最好尽量避免和她战斗。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/28": "“\\c[52]侵蚀地带\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n这里……总之非常危险。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/29": "最危险的是，出现的魔物\r\n明显比其他地区更强。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/30": "而且几乎没有城镇……。\r\n不要勉强打每一场，\r\n该逃的时候就要好好逃走。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/31": "“\\c[52]要塞\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/32": "这栋超级巨大的建筑究竟是什么？\r\n到底是谁建的啊。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/33": "嗯，这里似乎能获得很多武器。\r\n墙壁比城镇更坚固，魔物也很强，\r\n所以好武器要舍得用！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/34": "宝箱似乎也掉得不少，\r\n如果能顺利闯过去，装备一定会充实起来。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/35": "“\\c[52]海岸\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/36": "这是海洋与沙地交织的地区。\r\n和沙漠一样，要小心移动以及飞行敌人。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/37": "在这里前进时尤其要看小地图。\r\n如果特别擅长游泳倒还好，\r\n但陆地断开时没发现就会无路可走。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/38": "魔物以飞行系和鱼类居多吧。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/39": "对了，吃下\\c[52]海草\\c[0]后，\r\nST会在一定时间内持续恢复，\r\n不得不在水里游之前先吃点吧。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/40": "“\\c[52]大洞窟\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n这是被土墙包围的地区。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/41": "运气好能找到通路，\r\n否则就只能自己挖土前进。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/42": "还有，道路很狭窄，一旦正面遇到魔物，\r\n想逃掉恐怕很困难。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/43": "带着\\c[52]镐\\c[0]就能更容易挖开土墙。\r\n但镐的\\c[1]命中率较低\\c[0]，\r\n战斗时记得换上武器。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/44": "“\\c[52]天空\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/45": "……为什么会在天上？好高！太可怕了！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/46": "明明会飞为什么还害怕？\r\n我以前从没飞到过这么高的地方！\r\n当然可怕啊！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/47": "理所当然，飞行系魔物很多。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/48": "当然，要是掉进空洞，\r\n游戏结束就在所难免！\r\n这里必须比任何地方都更仔细看地图。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/49": "“\\c[52]大森林\\c[0]”的特点，对吧！\r\n这里几乎没有城镇和地下城，\r\n似乎是被森林与山地包围的地形。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/50": "恢复EN的道具很充足。\r\n要好好确保食物。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/51": "魔物也以动物和鸟类居多。\r\n在森林中前进时有时看不见魔物，\r\n要小心。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/52": "真是个厉害的地方……总觉得像梦境一样。\r\n不过我们现在到底走在什么地方呢？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/53": "地下城和城镇等各种东西都会出现。\r\n敌人似乎也特别强。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/54": "直到遇见冥王为止……\r\n我们都要小心前进！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/55": "为了拯救从这里连接的每一个世界……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_area.txt/56": "我们……\r\n一定要打倒冥王！\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/105": "你说什么？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/137": "是啊。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/0": "不装备武器和护甲根本毫无意义！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/285": "咦？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/304": "是啊。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/1": "不装备武器和护甲根本毫无意义！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/454": "抱歉，再说一次？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/490": "是啊。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/2": "不、不装备武器和护甲根本毫无意义！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/3": "哈……哈……\r\n武、武器…………。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/4": "抱歉，什么也没有。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/5": "咦？反过来，问\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]有没有想问我的事？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/6": "都当了你这么久的照料人了，现在才问问题啊……\r\n嗯～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～～嗯。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/1037": "我最喜欢你了！！",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/1064": "其实………。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/7": "你喜欢我吗？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/11": "…………………………………谢谢。",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/1359": "谁知道呢？",
  "choice/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/1383": "开玩笑的！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/12": "咦…………别这样啊，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]。\r\n你是开玩笑………………的对吧？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/13": "怎么会！太过分了，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！\r\n没想到你这么爱欺负人。\r\n喂，欺负我很有趣吗？喂，有趣吗？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/14": "哼……",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/15": "嗯——好吧……\r\n别开这种玩笑了，\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]！啊哈哈！！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/16": "（真的只是开玩笑……对吧……？）",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/17": "不过真没想到，\r\n遇见\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]之后，\r\n我竟会和勇者一起踏上拯救世界的旅途。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/18": "月夜里在森林散步时迷了路，\r\n一路走到城堡附近。\r\n那时向窗边的人搭了话。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/19": "聊起来发现我们特别合得来。\r\n谈了几次之后，\r\n我对\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]说起的各种人产生了兴趣。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/20": "我把这些告诉\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]以后，\r\n你便替我去请求国王。\r\n于是我就成了你的照料人。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/21": "城堡里汇集了全国各地的书，\r\n也有来自各地的人，\r\n我真的学到了非常多东西。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/22": "后来世界变成了这样，\r\n听说\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]要作为勇者踏上旅途，\r\n我当然只能跟着一起走了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/23": "哎呀，真不像我，居然说了这么多！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/24": "咦？你觉得也没那么不像？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/25": "真是的！",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/26": "说起来，城堡里的饭菜真的很好吃。\r\n厨师们一定都为我们费了不少心。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/27": "最厉害的还是厨师长。\r\n他会做超——级多的菜。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/28": "不管吃哪一道，都是绝品！\r\n啊啊，好怀念那个味道……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/29": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]的父亲康拉斯王，\r\n真的是个很了不起的人。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/30": "虽然有点可怕，\r\n但很受百姓爱戴。\r\n既有威严，治国也井井有条。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/31": "战争时期，\r\n他就像受到什么加护一样连战连胜。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/32": "简直就是完美超人。\r\n不过对\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]倒是有点宠呢。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/33": "说起来，听说他曾在城堡里\r\n研究曼德拉草的品种改良和人工养殖。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/34": "刚听说的时候，\r\n我还想\r\n“呃……那是什么，好可怕。”",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/35": "它们即使在恶劣环境里也能生长，\r\n营养价值也还不错。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/36": "而且据说“听见叫声也不会出事”。\r\n真是做了很厉害的研究。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/37": "不过……就没有朝不会叫的方向改良吗？\r\n我是这么想的。\r\n毕竟一叫起来又可怕又瘆人。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/38": "城堡的士兵们真的都非常忠诚，\r\n都是好人……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/39": "不过里面也有特别自以为了不起的人。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/40": "兵长剑术高强，\r\n技能也很丰富，不过……",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/41": "他教人的本事比剑术还好。\r\n训练新兵时，他的评价好像\r\n特别高呢？",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/42": "城堡里博学的人真的很多。\r\n光是听侍从们聊天，\r\n我就能学到各种东西。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/43": "但是！！那个药师。\r\n只有那家伙……我真的是应付不来。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/44": "第一次见面，他开口第一句就是“让我研究你！”？\r\n妖精确实很稀有，\r\n但他那异常亢奋的架势实在太怪了。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/45": "\\c[50]<PLAYER>\\c[0]要是没保护我，\r\n说不定我现在已经被泡在某种液体里，\r\n装进玻璃容器了……。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/46": "据说曼德拉草能人工养殖，\r\n很大程度上都是那家伙的功劳。",
  "message/data/event/skill/udb1_99_fairy_skilltalk_chat.txt/47": "他一定很聪明吧。\r\n虽然完全不知道他在想什么……。"
}
